WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.790
The night after the battle, AyShe held Pusula's sphere to her chest and couldn't sleep.

2
00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.850
At the top of the castle, someone was waiting for her. The Shadow.

3
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:15.570
Sila has fallen. Her army is scattered. Only I am left. And you.

4
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.400
I don't want to fight you.

5
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.180
But I do. Because you are everything I was supposed to be.

6
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:28.360
The Shadow attacked. Red and blue light clashed at the top of the tower.

7
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:33.700
Below, everyone was awake, but Eray didn't let anyone go up.

8
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:38.450
This is their fight. AyShe knows what she's doing. Trust me.

9
00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.260
Eray, when did you grow up so much?

10
00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:44.490
Last night. I bumped my head on the ceiling.

11
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.430
At the top of the tower, AyShe fell to the ground.

12
00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.400
The Shadow's red hand reached for her throat.

13
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.420
But AyShe didn't fight back. Instead, she took the Shadow's hand.

14
00:00:56.170 --> 00:01:00.730
Doctor Ekin forgot to give you a heart. But I won't forget.

15
00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:06.330
The twenty-three mark in AyShe's palm poured half of her light into the Shadow.

16
00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:11.750
The Shadow's mask cracked. Its red eyes slowly turned blue.

17
00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:14.430
What is this? Something is beating in my chest.

18
00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:17.660
It's a heart. Now you have one too.

19
00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:19.340
The mask fell to the ground.

20
00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:25.190
Underneath was a bewildered face that looked like AyShe, only younger.

21
00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:29.890
And that night, for the first time in Elyra, no one was an enemy.

